<title>UK: Dlr/mark above 1.81, highest since Aug 91-dealers.</title>
<headline>Dlr/mark above 1.81, highest since Aug 91-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar traded above 1.81 marks in Europe for the first time since August 1991, said dealers.</p>
<p>Dollar/mark touched a high of 1.8102 marks in morning Europe. By 0951 GMT, the dollar stepped back slightly, trading at 1.8088/98 compared with 1.7960/70 marks late Monday in Europe.</p>
<p>-- London forex, +44 171 542 6745</p>
